+// Flags are browser-wide but levels are per profile: keep the strictest level
+// of every loaded profile, so a new profile (default Medium) does not silently
+// drop the protections of a profile on Maximum.
+// shortcut: profiles not loaded right now are not seen; reading their Preferences
